    "n_faq_M7hUjR": {
      "type": "n_faq",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_grid_yDNGke": {
          "type": "faq_grid",
          "settings": {
            "faq_title_sub": "What is bio-cellulose, and how is it different from regular sheet masks?",
            "faq_title_desc": "<p>Bio-cellulose is a plant-based, ultra-fine fiber derived from fermented coconut water (or sometimes other natural sources). It forms a second-skin layer that adheres more closely and delivers actives deeper than cotton or paper masks. In your case, this mask uses medical-grade bio-cellulose to boost ingredient absorption, reduce slip, and lock in moisture.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_grid_zG4Q9R": {
          "type": "faq_grid",
          "settings": {
            "faq_title_sub": "How long should I leave the mask on for optimal results?",
            "faq_title_desc": "<p>The recommended wear time is 3 hours (or up to 8 hours, depending on skin type and comfort). However, if you don’t have that long, you’ll still see benefits in 30–45 minutes — hydration, plumping, and glow. (Users report good results even with shorter wear times.)</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_grid_CH8WaX": {
          "type": "faq_grid",
          "settings": {
            "faq_title_sub": "How often can I safely use the mask?",
            "faq_title_desc": "<p>You can use it 2–3 times a week as a treatment mask. For more intensive care (e.g. before special events or when skin looks dull), it’s safe to use more frequently for short stints, as the ingredients are clean and non-irritating. Always check how your skin reacts and reduce frequency if any irritation occurs.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_grid_aMxt4j": {
          "type": "faq_grid",
          "settings": {
            "faq_title_sub": "Is this mask suitable for sensitive or reactive skin?",
            "faq_title_desc": "<p>Yes — the formula is designed to be gentle, with clean, pronounceable ingredients (like hyaluronic acid, niacinamide, aloe, ceramide precursors). The bio-cellulose material also reduces friction or tugging on skin. Still, if you have known sensitivities (particularly to niacinamide, peptides, etc.), test on a small area first.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_grid_9YQRgp": {
          "type": "faq_grid",
          "settings": {
            "faq_title_sub": "What results can I realistically expect, and when will I see them?",
            "faq_title_desc": "<p>You may notice immediate improvements like better hydration, skin plumpness, and glow right after removing the mask. Over repeated use (a few weeks), you should see more even tone, smaller-looking pores, firmer texture, and that “glass skin” effect (a luminous, translucent finish).</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
